<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Susharman</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. c. 28 BCE</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Susharman was the fourth and last king of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kanva-dynasty">Kanva dynasty</a> of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/magadha">Magadha</a> in northern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a>, known from the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/puranas">Puranas</a>. According to them he was killed around 28 BCE by a king of the Satavahana dynasty, usually identified as its founder <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/simuka">Simuka</a>, bringing the Kanva line to an end after some 45 years.</p></div>
